@startuml
title Plane State Diagram

[*] --> Order
Order --> Arrival : plane arrives
Arrival --> Preparation : maintenance check passes
Preparation --> Operations : condition good and schedule available
Operations --> Maintenance : no more scheduled flights or maintenance required
Maintenance --> Preparation : maintenance completed
Preparation --> OutOfService : plane unavailable for use
OutOfService --> [*]

state Order
state Arrival
state Preparation
state Operations
state Maintenance
state OutOfService
@enduml
